coder › Fixed off-by-one in `paginate` and added validation + tests.

Changed:
- `src/paginate.ts`: `start` is now `(page - 1) * perPage` (was `page * perPage`, which skipped page 1). Added `RangeError` when `page < 1` or `perPage < 1`. `slice(start, start + perPage)` naturally handles partial last page and past-the-end → `[]`.
- `src/paginate.test.ts`: added 5 tests — page 1 returns first `perPage` items, last page returns remainder, past-the-end returns `[]`, page 0 throws `RangeError`, perPage 0 throws `RangeError`.

